Technical Note / 技术说明：
The liquid nitrogen channels are designed to be pre-filled to a steady cryogenic state before the CPU cold boot/overclocking is initiated. This ensures uniform thermal distribution across the entire 3D-stacked CCD stack, minimizing thermal stress and unlocking a more aggressive frequency scaling potential.
(液氮通道设计为在CPU冷启动/超频前预先充满以达到稳定深冷状态。这确保了整个3D堆叠CCD整体热分布均匀，最大限度地降低热应力，并释放更激进的频率扩展潜力。)
